# Context for frontend/Dockerfile (repository root). Only frontend/ and backend/src/contracts are needed.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.github
docs
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
backend/uploads
# Secrets never enter the build. frontend/.env.production holds only public build-time values.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!frontend/.env.production
